 ## Found on this game
 
+- [Save-folder preview and selection before import](../../../docs/reference/packing.md#importing-native-save-files-without-an-emulator-specific-conversion): [Mac save-import validation](#mac-routes).
+- [An import file picker opens wider than the game window](../../../docs/reference/packing.md#an-import-file-picker-opens-wider-than-the-game-window): the player's screenshot exposed the oversized one-line hint. The app was rebuilt with a two-line hint, and only its cached open-panel dimensions were reset; game settings and saves were kept.
+- Import review also found generic [guest-name confinement](../../../docs/reference/services.md#imported-guest-names-escape-legacy-save-migration), [archive expansion/source-alias](../../../docs/reference/packing.md#untrusted-save-imports-exhaust-staging-or-replace-their-source), and [cloud reconciliation](../../../docs/reference/services.md#an-explicit-save-import-is-undone-by-cloud-synchronization) issues. Their regressions use disposable synthetic saves; they are not additional gameplay or imported-progress acceptance.
